# BUGS

PCIe 0, whose slot the Orange Pi RV2 doesn't have, isn't driven through the combo PHY: it is calibrated, or USB 3's.
The receiver's termination isn't held on in USB 3's mode (the vendor's `rx_always_on`).
No PHY can be turned off: its PLL runs until the board resets.
